# Top Models Only — No Exceptions

When referencing LLM models in this codebase, use ONLY top-tier models:

| Provider | Model | Forbidden Alternatives |
|----------|-------|------------------------|
| **OpenAI** | `gpt-5.3-codex` | `gpt-4o`, `gpt-5.2-chat-latest`, `o4-mini` |
| **Anthropic** | `claude-opus-4-6` | `claude-sonnet`, `claude-haiku` |
| **Google Text** | `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` | `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.5-pro` |
| **Google Image** | `gemini-3-pro-image-preview` | `gemini-2.5-flash-image` |

The config file (`meeseeks/box/00_llm_router_config.json`) defines all models, but code defaults MUST use top-tier only.

Any of these in code defaults is a bug — fix immediately:
- `gemini-2.5-flash`
- `claude-sonnet`
- `claude-haiku`
- `gpt-4o`
- `o4-mini`
- `gemini-2.5-flash-image`
